              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "After the click: landing and store pages (visits, conversion, bounce, LCP; bounce and LCP do not apply to store pages), then the onboarding steps, the time to the first dashboard and the activation rate per platform segment.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#4B5563"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "This window: App Store CVR is flat (31 %), so the trial → paid drop is not on the landing side; the largest onboarding loss is Connect data source; median time to activation 26 h.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#4B5563"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Activation counts are cohorted by sign-up day: the last 7 days (30 for the time chart) are partial by construction.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
